At Aobayama Harbal Village in Nakayama, Takahama Town, winter illuminations for the first time have begun, and the park is enveloped in a gentle light.
The winter illuminations, which began on November 26th, are interspersed with fifty thousand LED light bulbs according to walking paths, lawns, etc., as well as camphor trees that are 20m high.
A visitor from Shiga Prefecture said, "It's been a long time since I've been in Fukui, and I'm surprised that there is such a place.
It was very beautiful and I was able to relax," he said.
The illuminations are designed for the first time so that you can feel the healing while avoiding secrecy, and they are lit from 5pm to 8pm on Fridays, Saturdays, and Sundays until December 25th.
